      "identified_by": "it arrives in the pre-alert group mailbox the bot has access to",
      "instructions": "The SOP says documentation must be reported by email but never says to whom. The sender is the obvious candidate and is deliberately not assumed here. One email carries a subject and a list of attachments, and the attachments are what there are several of; that a shipment gets several emails over days is a fact about the trigger rather than about what an email is.",
      "name": "Pre-alert email"
    },
